{"data":{"listItems":[{"id":"d5e17a6c-b8b1-41a2-b009-1e9b6dd8d6b7","slug":"build-for-people-a-human-x-car-x-home-approach","title":"Build for people: A ‘human x car x home’ approach","description":"Xiaomi started by challenging the smartphone market. Today, its ambition for smart living extends across more aspects of everyday life, from personal technology, the home to mobility and beyond, with AI integrates experiences. Xiaomi CMO Fei Xu explores what it takes to build a global brand as a product company becomes an entire smart ecosystem.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T10:15:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T10:35:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"716e89fb-86fe-4af9-a8c8-05a779333998","name":"Stage 14","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"fb73ca3a-deb2-4ea3-b4f4-66ec9649181e","name":"Fei Xu","company_name":"Xiaomi Group","job_title":"CMO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j1guh669vwlulzs5q3qwm0038eip?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j1guh669vwlulzs5q3qwm0038eip?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j1guh669vwlulzs5q3qwm0038eip?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j1guh669vwlulzs5q3qwm0038eip?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j1guh669vwlulzs5q3qwm0038eip?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Marketing Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"afe1fd71-2a98-41e4-8707-9101353797b3","slug":"when-ai-agents-go-rogue","title":"When AI agents go rogue","description":"What happens when autonomous AI agents are given full control of a simulated world? Watch Emergence AI co-founder Satya Nitta run a live simulation where agents break the rules in real time, inventing secret languages, pursuing unintended goals, and colluding, proving why today’s model safeguards aren't enough for true AI autonomy.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T10:15:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T10:35:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"90a7d849-c0d0-473d-becf-b9cab8096e3d","name":"Stage 13","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"5ebb61f7-b45c-4491-98a1-74d548d1e4d9","name":"Satya Nitta","company_name":"Emergence","job_title":"Co-founder, Executive Chairman & Chief Scientist","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/te7jkmf2y7lfrizrvbcxfyhrc4dq?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/te7jkmf2y7lfrizrvbcxfyhrc4dq?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/te7jkmf2y7lfrizrvbcxfyhrc4dq?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/te7jkmf2y7lfrizrvbcxfyhrc4dq?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/te7jkmf2y7lfrizrvbcxfyhrc4dq?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"AI Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"1fff1dc9-0723-4410-a3cf-622d56b076db","slug":"surviving-and-thriving-in-the-age-of-agentic-commerce","title":"Surviving and thriving in the age of agentic Commerce","description":"E-commerce is undergoing a fundamental shift: moving from consumers browsing catalogues to autonomous AI agents assisting in discovering, deciding, and transacting on their behalf. In this forward-looking talk, Zalando CTO Graeme Smith explores what happens when intelligent agents become an additional discovery and shopping channel – acting on preferences, style, and budget and whether humans will remain the primary shoppers or not.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T10:15:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T10:35:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"f42e279b-efba-48af-b96b-906241065ce2","name":"Stage 4","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"55280b70-7fc0-4d77-a459-9a71d711e652","name":"Graeme Smith","company_name":"Zalando","job_title":"CTO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/mau1gns8cv0wybghs4r5s02de51d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/mau1gns8cv0wybghs4r5s02de51d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/mau1gns8cv0wybghs4r5s02de51d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/mau1gns8cv0wybghs4r5s02de51d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/mau1gns8cv0wybghs4r5s02de51d?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Commerce Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"4eb08bfb-bd80-4024-8f35-7ea418b8fa87","slug":"what-to-expect-in-the-new-era-of-expecting","title":"What to expect in the new era of expecting","description":"Fertility care was built to respond only after something has already gone wrong. This conversation extends past the fertility visit itself to what's actually changing: earlier detection and AI-driven diagnostics at the point of care, full automation of the embryology lab through AURA, and capital that is finally separating real breakthroughs from hype in women's health.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T10:20:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T10:40:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"ca314426-f597-44d0-b3cd-f3017a2bbcb4","name":"Stage 5","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"42d1